  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lac Nokou&#xe9; et Lagune de Porto-Novo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project focuses on providing an Integrated Water Resource Management (IWRM) solution to hydrological, ecological and water quality challenges in Lac Nokou&#xe9; in Benin.The project consists of: - Ecological recovery through deepening of parts of the lake via dredging,- Use of dredged sediment for construction of flood defence structures and land reclamation for urban infrastructure development,- Intervention in the salt-sweet water cycle of the lake and lagoon throughout the seasons,- Cleaning up and redeveloping banks of river and lake and drainage canals,- Measures for water quality improvement (linked to the project).</narrative>
  </description>
